":"If your package in a paid order shipped by air has had no tracking updates for over 15 days and has not been delivered, you can request a free reshipment or refund because the package may have been lost in transit. If you receive the package after your request has been approved, you may be allowed to keep it for free in certain circumstances without needing to return it.\nIn certain circumstances, including but not limited to natural disasters and other force majeure circumstances, you may not be able to receive compensation or request a refund if there have not been updates. Eligibility timeframes may vary depending on the shipping method, order type, and other order details. After placing an order, please refer to the delivery guarantee on the order details page for the applicable timeframe.","color":"#222222","fontSize":13,"bold":false,"italic":false},"viewMoreText":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"For more exceptions and details about the policy, please refer to our policy page","color":"#555555","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false,"url":"\u002Fpackage-lost-compensation-policy.html","mark":false}]},{"title":{"type":"TEXT","text":"30-day no delivery refund","color":"#222222","fontSize":13,"bold":true,"italic":false},"subTitle":{"type":"TEXT","text":"If your package in a paid order shipped by air isn't delivered within 30 days after shipment, you can request a free reshipment or a full refund. If you receive the package after your request has been approved, you may be allowed to keep it for free in certain circumstances without needing to return it.\nIn certain circumstances, including but not limited to natural disasters and other force majeure circumstances, you may not be able to request a free reshipment or a refund if your order wasn't delivered. Eligibility timeframes may vary depending on the shipping method, order type, and other order details. After placing an order, please refer to the delivery guarantee on the order details page for the applicable timeframe.","color":"#222222","fontSize":13,"bold":false,"italic":false},"viewMoreText":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"For more exceptions and details about the policy, please refer to our policy page","color":"#555555","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false,"url":"\u002Fno-delivery-compensation-policy.html","mark":false}]}],"key":"DELIVERY_GUARANTEE"},{"title":{"type":"TEXT","text":"Free returns","color":"#0B8000","fontSize":18,"fontWeight":700,"bold":true,"italic":false},"contentList":[{"content":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"The first return of one or multiple returnable items for EVERY order is free! To avoid additional shipping costs of multiple returns, we suggest that you select the items you wish to return together.","color":"#000000","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false}]},{"content":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"The return window for most items is 90 days from the date of purchase. All eligible items can be returned within the return window in their original condition for a full refund.","color":"#000000","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false}],"viewMoreText":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"For more exceptions and details about the policy, please refer to our policy page","color":"#555555","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false,"url":"\u002Freturn-and-refund-policy.html","mark":false}]}],"key":"FREE_RETURN"},{"title":{"type":"TEXT","text":"Price adjustment","color":"#0B8000","fontSize":18,"bold":true,"italic":false},"additionalTitle":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"Items purchased from Temu are eligible for our price adjustment policy. Temu will provide the price difference in the currency that the order was paid in if the selling price of the item purchased was reduced within 30 days of payment in the same country or region. The shipment of your order will not be affected by applying for a price adjustment before you receive your item(s). You can request a price adjustment refund by selecting the relevant order in 'Your Orders' and clicking on the 'Price adjustment' button.","color":"#222222","fontSize":13,"bold":false,"italic":false},{"type":"TEXT","text":"Items that are promotional or no longer available may not be eligible for our price adjustment policy. Fees, including but not limited to shipping fees, will be excluded for any price adjustment calculation. Temu reserves the right to the final interpretation of our price adjustment policy, the right to modify the terms of this policy at any time, and the right to deny any price adjustment at our sole discretion.","color":"#222222","fontSize":13,"bold":false,"italic":false}],"key":"PRICE_ADJUSTMENT"},{"title":{"type":"TEXT","text":"Minimum Order Value","color":"#0B8000","fontSize":18,"fontWeight":700,"bold":true,"italic":false},"additionalTitle":[{"type":"TEXT","text":"Temu has order minimums to place your order. The applicable thresholds are detailed before you submit your order.","color":"#000000","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":400,"bold":false,"italic":false}],"key":"USER_INTERCEPT_FLOAT_THRESHOLD"}]},"extensionMap":{"newExpireTimeDisplayStyle":false}},"extensionMap":{}},"bgColor":"#000000","trackInfo":{"pageElSn":200369},"key":"FREE_RETURN","ignoreImmersion":false},{"type":"PRICE_ADJUSTMENT","icon":"https:\u002F\u002Faimg.kwcdn.com\u002Fupload_aimg\u002Ficonphoto\u002F777d7b6a-ac68-4e05-9cc4-3c915f1b6d5d.png.slim.png","svgPath":"M663.5 905.5c4.8 22.1-9.1 43.9-31.2 48.8-36.9 8.1-74.8 11.4-112.5 9.8-22.6-1-40.1-20.1-39.2-42.7 1-22.6 20.1-40.1 42.7-39.2 30.7 1.3 61.4-1.4 91.5-7.9 22.1-4.8 43.9 9.1 48.7 31.2z m-315.5-78.5l9.4 5.7c24 14.1 48.7 25.2 74.3 33.3 21.6 6.8 33.5 29.9 26.6 51.4-6.8 21.6-29.9 33.5-51.4 26.7-31.5-10-61.8-23.5-91.1-40.8l-11.5-7c-19.1-12.1-24.8-37.4-12.8-56.5 12.1-19.1 37.4-24.8 56.5-12.8z m488.2-33.6c15.1 16.8 13.7 42.7-3.1 57.8-28.2 25.3-59.4 46.8-92.8 64.1-20.1 10.4-44.8 2.5-55.2-17.6-10.4-20.1-2.5-44.8 17.6-55.2 27.3-14.1 52.7-31.6 75.7-52.2 16.8-15.1 42.7-13.7 57.8 3.1z m-614.1-100.