 bought from TEMU, I'm most satisfied with these. They are exactly as described by the seller. I highly recommend them!","needHighlightTexts":[]},"picListIndex":1,"extendParams":{"enhanceTranslateText":"1"},"needHighlightTexts":[],"isSimilarReview":false,"list":[{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a488c0de\u002F80699fc7-ee0b-4198-8ef2-59b350aea82f.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a488c0de\u002F82d1d685-52ac-407f-9c01-19e3a87a1248.jpeg","width":1200,"height":900},{"url":"https:\u002F\u002Frewimg-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Freview-image\u002F21a488c0de\u002F2482beae-9b1e-4643-bfd9-6b8236e44b4f.jpeg","width":900,"height":1200}],"specs":[{"spec_key":"Size","spec_value":"Label size: CN 38(EU 38)"},{"spec_key":"Color","spec_value":"Ladies' Fashion Mid-tube Rain Boots in Burgundy Red"}]},{"reviewId":"74773319055844109","reviewVersion":0,"comment":"Labai geri ir gražūs guminiai batai - kaip tik tokių ir norėjau. Įdėjau vilnonius įdėklus į batų vidų - tilps ir storesnės kojinės. Batai labai tinka plačiai pėdai. Mielai juos nešiosiu lietingu oru.\nBatus pristatė greičiau nei tikėjausi.","time":1791225130,"concatTimeLang":"on Oct 5, 2026","concatRichText":{"textRich":[{"type":0,"value":"in","fontSize":14,"fontColor":"#757575","fontWeight":400,"verAlign":2},{"type":100,"value":"https:\u002F\u002Faimg.kwcdn.com\u002Fupload_aimg\u002Fopeningemail\u002Fflags\u002Feafa885a-d427-4d07-acf4-1acd45d307e8.png.slim.png","width":17,"height":13,"paddingStart":4,"paddingEnd":4},{"type":0,"value":"on Oct 5, 2026","fontSize":14,"fontColor":"#757575","fontWeight":400,"verAlign":2}],"bgColor":"#FFFFFF","ariaLabel":"in Lithuania on Oct 5, 2026"},"name":"au***sk","avatar":"https:\u002F\u002Favatar-eu.kwcdn.com\u002Favatarj-eu\u002Favatar\u002Fdefault\u002F2edee16b-7062-4353-b7da-b109a7bde981.jpg","isOwnReview":false,"score":5,"goodsId":"601103684936461","skuId":17611047637734,"goodsSpecificReviewLevelI